### Test Cleanup Endpoints
### Pastikan sudah login sebagai ADMIN untuk mendapatkan access token

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Get Cleanup Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Dry Run - Cleanup Unverified Users
### Preview user yang akan dihapus tanpa actually delete
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/unverified-users?dryRun=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Cleanup Unverified Users (Actual)
### Hapus user dengan verification expired > 24 jam
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/unverified-users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Cleanup Unverified Users (Custom Expiration)
### Hapus user dengan verification expired > 48 jam
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/unverified-users?expirationHours=48
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Dry Run - Cleanup Never-Verified Users
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/never-verified-users?dryRun=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Cleanup Never-Verified Users (Actual)
### Hapus user yang tidak pernah verify email > 7 hari
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/never-verified-users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Cleanup Expired Verification Tokens
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/expired-verification-tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Cleanup Expired 2FA Tokens
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/expired-2fa-tokens
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Dry Run - Run All Cleanup Tasks
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/run-all?dryRun=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Run All Cleanup Tasks (Actual)
### HATI-HATI: Ini akan menjalankan semua cleanup sekaligus!
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/run-all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Check Stats After Cleanup
GET {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###############################################
### Testing Flow - Complete Scenario
###############################################

### Step 1: Check stats sebelum cleanup
GET {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 2: Dry run untuk preview
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/unverified-users?dryRun=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 3: Review hasil dry run
### Jika OK, lanjut ke step 4

### Step 4: Execute cleanup
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/unverified-users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Step 5: Check stats sesudah cleanup
GET {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###############################################
### Create Test User (untuk testing cleanup)
###############################################

### 1. Register test user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User Cleanup",
  "email": "test-cleanup@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Check user terbuat (akan unverified)
### User ini akan otomatis di-cleanup setelah 24 jam jika tidak verify

### 3. Untuk testing, bisa manually update expiration di database:
### UPDATE sys_EmailVerification 
### SET expiresAt = NOW() - INTERVAL '25 hours'
### WHERE user_id = (SELECT id FROM sys_User WHERE email = 'test-cleanup@example.com');

### 4. Run cleanup
POST {{baseUrl}}/cleanup/unverified-users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Verify user terhapus
### Check di database atau coba login dengan user tersebut (harusnya gagal)

